! The road's ashes ~ finished work beside the founding road

The founding road (<<~ loulou uri=`lar:///ha.ka.ba/lares/docs/stable-founding-road`>>) shows pending work alone; this carrier gathers what stands finished (operator, 2026-11-19: //"we should consider moving the 'done/ashes/o-takiage' sections to a completely seperate meme. The filter based collections/lists should then allow moving to the ashes pile with a tag or something like that, and querying the Roadmap will only show pending work."//). A road child moves here by one act: it takes the tag `road/ashes` beside its own, and its text stays in its own carrier. A child takes the tag when its work stands fully built, burned or superseded; a ruling stays law in the road and never takes it. The landed leaps, the o-takiage rite's complete items and the one-line ashes moved here from the road whole on the same day.

